WHAT DARK MATTER IS
-------------------
The Noether charge of the MOND scalar's shift symmetry, in TWO states selected
by the local acceleration:
  g ~ a_0  -> PHANTOM     (equilibrated, baryon-tied, M_ph/M_b = r/r_M)
  g >> a_0 -> FREE DUST   (collisionless, independent of a_0)

THE BULLET CLUSTER, RESOLVED
----------------------------
In the merging subclusters g/a_0 ~ 9, so the sector does not equilibrate and
the dark mass is essentially all FREE DUST -- collisionless, passing through
with the galaxies. The baryon-tied phantom is suppressed. Hence the lensing
peaks follow the galaxies while the X-ray gas sits between, exactly as
observed -- WITHOUT a particle.

This is a genuine success: standard MOND struggles here because a pure force
law ties the mass to the gas. The two-state structure is what resolves it.

IS IT A SCAM?
-------------
The phenomenon is real -- six independent bodies of evidence, all accounted
for. What this framework rejects is the ONTOLOGY: there is no particle. The
dark mass is a property of the gravitational sector (a conserved charge), not
a substance added to it. Forty years of null direct-detection results are
therefore not a crisis -- they are the prediction.

STILL OPEN: the 22% a_0 discrepancy (H029's decisive test); S_8 (fixed
prediction 2.044%); RAR-redshift (H026: NOT ESTABLISHED).

